  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞架子里杂乱地堆着校报。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞上面登载着学生撰写的\n　关于学校活动等内容的报道。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 D5 0C}……看来没什么关系。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}这样啊。\n我还以为会有什么线索……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 0A}以后也许还会再来。\n在地图上记下来，免得忘了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 2A 06}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}嗯？　这篇报道……\n写了些让人在意的事。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞看看报上的报道吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“漆黑校舍中的神秘灯光。”\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:5:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“接到附近居民反映，\n　深夜时分，已经停用的旧校舍内\n　曾出现灯光。”\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:5:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“是否有人擅自进入，\n　或目击过可疑人物？\n　知情同学请到教职员办公室说明。”\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:5:4",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞报道到这里就结束了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C6 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}总觉得好瘆人……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}所以，这又怎么了？\n跟我们有关系吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3F 06}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}不，问题在背面。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……报道背面用红字\n　写着一段费解的文字……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞{F2 01 03 01}“最初的１步向东。\n　然后向北２步、向东２步、\n　向北２步、向西３步。”{F2 01 01 01}\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:9:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞{F2 01 03 01}“向南２步、向东１步、\n　向南２步，最后向西１步，\n　回到起点。”{F2 01 01 01}\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:9:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞红字写成的文字到这里就结束了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_010",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 03 01 02 01}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C2 07}……是让我们照着走吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:11:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 3C 06}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}恐怕是的……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:11:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}不过，我们所在位置的东边是墙，\n所以至少不是从这里开始……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:11:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_011",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}能按这个路线走的地方……\n如果已经画在地图上就好了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:12:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_012",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 11 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 15 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}熊……\n小熊没信心记住这些啊……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:13:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_013",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 09}确实……\n要背下来有点长啊。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e723_220.bf.json:14:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0132",
